{"id":31414,"imdb":"tt0111341","en":"Satantango","orig":"Sátántangó","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"Inhabitants of a small village in Hungary deal with the effects of the fall of Communism. The town's source of revenue, a factory, has closed, and the locals, who include a doctor and three couples, await a cash payment offered in the wake of the shuttering. Irimias, a villager thought to be dead, returns and, unbeknownst to the locals, is a police informant. In a scheme, he persuades the villagers to form a commune with him.","rd":"1994-04-28","rt":432,"g":[18],"lang":"hu","budget":1500000,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Von Vietinghoff Filmproduktion","logo":null,"c":"DE"},{"n":"Vega Film","logo":"/4P6c8TiJZhL2z7b0LbPOUTZwP4z.png","c":"CH"},{"n":"Mozgókép Innovációs Társulás és Alapítvány","logo":null,"c":""},{"n":"Magyar Televízió","logo":null,"c":"HU"},{"n":"TSR","logo":"/suKdkPTtHn0DzGYmrXCA506dJON.png","c":"CH"}],"countries":["DE","HU","CH"],"langs":["Hungarian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"DE","d":"1994-02-18"},{"c":"HU","d":"1994-04-28"},{"c":"US","d":"1994-10-09"},{"c":"NL","d":"1994-12-22"},{"c":"GB","d":"2006-11-13"},{"c":"CN","d":"2026-04-18"},{"c":"TW","d":"2026-09-06"}],"dir":["Béla Tarr"],"prod":["György Fehér","Joachim von Vietinghoff","Ruth Waldburger"],"wri":["Béla Tarr","László Krasznahorkai","Barna Mihók","Péter Dobai","Mihály Víg"],"mus":["Mihály Víg"],"dop":["Gábor Medvigy"],"cast":[{"n":"Mihály Víg","ch":"Irimiás","p":"/71v1NmDSD4i8ZJVNIkbvcwzVMs4.jpg"},{"n":"Putyi Horváth","ch":"Petrina","p":"/9aKiMvr7X69X6mNQdcDZTZ7JnWU.jpg"},{"n":"Székely B. Miklós","ch":"Futaki","p":"/82IjLmtqqv6sVf8j6vphi0kxBn7.jpg"},{"n":"Erika Bók","ch":"Estike","p":null},{"n":"László feLugossy","ch":"Schmidt","p":null},{"n":"Alfréd Járai","ch":"Halics","p":"/gZgfWedQdgFV69bzCtKwZbQ8Nbo.jpg"},{"n":"János Derzsi","ch":"Kráner","p":"/8ER5TWn3Wm0UYiwuXEVTcUZaHD1.jpg"},{"n":"Irén Szajki","ch":"Kránerné","p":null},{"n":"Éva Almássy Albert","ch":"Schmidtné","p":"/bGQtug5lUbvJF1CKDu2REo0